"></path></svg><p class="blog-sources__checked">The public pages below cover Pine identity, planting, growth, Tapper, map limits, and uses. The Pine Tree, Pine Cone, and Trees pages disagree on the unfertilized growth median, so no single number should be treated as a universal Pine growth time.</p></div></div></section>"

